Revision history for Coin::Hnoss

0.007_01 2026-11-09
       - Fix Currency::Repository->default: replace invalid `state`
         (was missing `use feature 'state'`) with a file-scoped lexical.

0.007  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency::Repository with a built-in ISO 4217
         table (active and historical codes) and a configurable fallback
         exponent.
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency->exponent and ->subunit, delegating to
         the default repository.

0.006_02 2026-11-09
       - Fix allocate: allocate on |amount| then negate, so that
         allocate(-x, ...) is the element-wise negation of
         allocate(x, ...).

0.006  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money->allocate.

0.005  2026-11-09
       - Add comparison and predicates to Coin::Hnoss::Money.
       - Overload <=>, ==, !=, <, >, <=, >= to use compare.

0.004_01 2026-11-09
       - Document floor semantics for divide / divide_with_remainder.

0.004  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Exception base class.
       - Add arithmetic to Coin::Hnoss::Money.

0.003  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Money (immutable amount + currency value object).

0.002  2026-11-09
       - Add Coin::Hnoss::Currency (ISO 4217 code value object).

0.001  2026-11-09
       - Initial skeleton.
